        "text": "The target is Delaware's state row for August 2026 in CMS dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c. CMS's renewal tables define the ex parte percentage as metric 5a1 divided by metric 5: ex parte renewals as a share of all beneficiaries due for renewal. Resolution uses the first published original (O) submission, with the share computed to one decimal."
