        "text": "Publication-date audit: CMS's official release page records June 2026 released September 25, 2026 and August 2025 released November 28, 2025. No official future release calendar or announcement confirming December 15, 2026 for August 2026 was found. The required ledger resolutionDate is retained with this verification gap disclosed; resolution remains the first published original August 2026 Delaware row."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Upside risk is a favorable August renewal cohort or improved automated matching: a repeat of August 2025's 52 percent would land above the interval. Downside risk is weaker automatic verification or a processing failure that shifts substantial renewals into form-based or pending outcomes; a share below 26.4 percent would fall outside the interval. CMS also cautions that renewal classification practices can affect reported ex parte rates."
